[{"title":"草间深江而有行舟之老","author":"徐渭","text":"杜老唤鸬鹚，江深草阁低。\n沿江寻酒伴，船过石头西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40099,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"徐渭","text":"夜寒霜露濡，飞鸟去何处。\n秋日白苍苍，空亭数株树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40100,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子臣絮其室之故镜再铸索词","author":"徐渭","text":"复收旧鸾魄，来作新蝉耀。\n临妆人巳亡，倚面向谁照。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40101,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄公子迎其母夫人归黄岩","author":"徐渭","text":"半臂黑貂裘，迎亲下娣楼。\n新城贼难破，母去不须忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40102,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得珠川篇赠人号","author":"徐渭","text":"结屋临飞瀑，清流绕积书。\n要观飘洒意，不是羡明珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40103,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题三仙炼丹图","author":"徐渭","text":"自服大还丹，千秋去紫烟。\n徒闻不曾见，画里觅神仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40104,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为沈嘉则题枯木画四首 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"长幅小藤又，题诗挂帐纱。\n万枝无一叶，留得雪为花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40105,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为沈嘉则题枯木画四首 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"墨颖作丛叉，流阴映牖纱。\n更直添一种，数朵古藤花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40106,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为沈嘉则题枯木画四首 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"小干学鱼叉，空心蚁窦纱。\n参天今百尺，不解作飞花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40107,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为沈嘉则题枯木画四首 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"诗成手八叉，僧意欲笼纱。\n不敢轻枯树，春来不放花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40108,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送章君游江西","author":"徐渭","text":"把酒上江阁，问君何所之。\n鄱阳湖口阔，烟水渺相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40109,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"近江为赵君赋","author":"徐渭","text":"洗墨临池客，移家住近江。\n越山青隔岸，偏入学书窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40110,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"徐渭","text":"佛桑新到处，菡萏正撩人。\n共贮冰纹馆，他乡姊妹亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40111,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兰竹","author":"徐渭","text":"兰与竹相并，非关调本同。\n氤氲香不远，聊为引清风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40112,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题水仙兰花","author":"徐渭","text":"水仙开最晚，何事伴兰苕。\n亦如摩诘叟，雪里画芭蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40113,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题牡丹竹","author":"徐渭","text":"牡丹须绿叶，春早叶难多。\n莫道扶持少，新篁捧绛罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40114,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牵牛花","author":"徐渭","text":"叶似青云剪，花如碧玉凌。\n鸟来栖不响，朵朵巧垂铃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40115,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙","author":"徐渭","text":"江水拂镜明，江波蹙鲜滑。\n湘君少侍儿，烦侬步罗袜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40116,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"徐渭","text":"何年顾虎头，有此传家手。\n老夫细摩挲，俨似黄子久。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40117,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别刘凝和会试二首 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"御榜揭红墙，春风马上郎。\n特引双蝴蝶，来荣插帽芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40118,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别刘凝和会试二首 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"知君貌堂堂，称此罗衣裳。\n若个官娃剪，须教特地长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40119,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复上虞复西溪湖","author":"徐渭","text":"复此西湖水，侯即西门豹。\n湖水何足论，溉我三乡稻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40120,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复上虞复西溪湖","author":"徐渭","text":"湖上香稻熟，湖中鲤鱼长。\n网鱼煮香稻，千载荐桐香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40121,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伐木图","author":"徐渭","text":"一斧劈残深雾，万牛挽动横沙。\n知费几番造化，正宜今日皇家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40122,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔","author":"徐渭","text":"树杪几家村屋，波心无数渔船。\n试令一只独往，或到武陵洞天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40123,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樵","author":"徐渭","text":"斧倦坡前束担，薪枝兼有青红。\n王质是侬乡老，烂柯只在山中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40124,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芍药琼花","author":"徐渭","text":"芍药扬州第一，琼花又道无双。\n若使共图此幅，镜中西子毛嫱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40125,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忠","author":"徐渭","text":"君臣相得鱼水，荆益稍展风云。\n前后出师二表，始终鼎足三分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40126,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝","author":"徐渭","text":"尺牍不过百字，美名却映千秋。\n皋鱼泣血洒洒，啼鸟风木飕飕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40127,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"廉","author":"徐渭","text":"内省既不惶巳，焚香何用告天。\n系马之椿谨细，纪过之豆同筌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40128,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"节","author":"徐渭","text":"十九年来持节，一只雁去酸心。\n饭碗雪毡北塞，火坑煅炼南金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40129,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"愁歌","author":"徐渭","text":"兰膏午夜华灯，黄河千尺层冰。\n不知何时消尽，应须有日凋零。\n独予愁心苦泪，还如转环建瓴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40130,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪竹 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"雪压烟迷月又蹉，前村昏黑水增波。\n梅花也自难张主，数尺寒稍奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40131,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪竹 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"万丈云间老桧萋，下藏鹰犬在塘西。\n快心猎尽梅林雀，野竹空空雪一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40132,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪竹 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"画成雪竹太萧骚，掩节埋清折好梢。\n独有一般差似我，积高千丈恨难消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40133,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风竹 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"画里濡毫不敢浓，囱间欲肖碧玲珑。\n两竿稍上无多叶，何事风波满太空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40134,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风竹 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"枯枝固是转相寻，数叶何劳便米侵。\n恶梗强鞭穿地遍，秋风偏要飒幽林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40135,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风竹 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"苦笋穿苔破出封，摇风弄月碧玲珑。\n昨宵偶掘行鞭看，多少泥中掘杀侬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40136,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风竹 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"五竿细筱似荷茼，数点青苔草面封。\n莫怪枝枝半无叶，昨宵风雨折长松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40137,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风竹 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"只堪拟作钓竿横，岂有干云拂雾情。\n寄语风霜休更忘，只今巳自瘦伶仃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40138,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风竹 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"竹劲由来缺样同，画家虽巧也难工。\n细看昨夜西风里，若个琅玕不向东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40139,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风竹 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"鸮鸟尝依恶木栖，鹤鹩多宿竹间枝。\n冯君莫画生风叶，卵破巢倾始得知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40140,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨竹 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"小露垂梢雨压竿，真成滴泪不曾乾。\n问渠何事能哀甚，屈杀蛙泥笋一攒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40141,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨竹 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"枝枝叶叶自成排，嫩嫩枯枯向上裁。\n信手扫来非著意，是晴是雨恁人猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40142,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画兰","author":"徐渭","text":"醉抹醒涂总是春，百花枝上掇精神。\n自从画得湘兰后，更不閒题与俗人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40143,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画杏花","author":"徐渭","text":"一策万言如有神，本朝租士数罗伦。\n今朝骑马看花者，肯与罗伦作后尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40144,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙","author":"徐渭","text":"阒阚前头第一班，绝无烟火上朱颜。\n问渠何事长如此，不语行拖双玉环。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40145,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画竹","author":"徐渭","text":"带醉写竹天正阴，扇头雷雨黑沉沉。\n晓来苍龙失伴侣，直入君家袖里寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40146,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画荷","author":"徐渭","text":"肥甘座上不须查，浓醴筵中可少茶。\n鹅鸭街头差免俗，镜湖大叶数茎花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40147,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻王子三首 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"秋风吹叶下纷纷，几度寻君不见君。\n云里愁看雁行去，天边恼杀凤笙鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40148,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻王子三首 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"秋风吹叶下阶庭，几度寻君市上行。\n正似溪分两行水，又如天断一层云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40149,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻王子三首 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"秋风吹叶打寒囱，对影和人只一双。\n小小深杯斟玉液，遥遥长夜拨银缸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40150,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏画中红梅","author":"徐渭","text":"一条斜扫挂长空，不与寻常桃李同。\n翠干朱花虽觉媚，竹梢松杪尚相容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40151,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画插瓶梅送人","author":"徐渭","text":"苦无竹叶倾三斝，聊取梅花插一稍。\n冰碎古瓶何太酷，顿教人弃汝州窑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40152,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红菊","author":"徐渭","text":"菊花自古只黄花，改样连年渐渐差。\n不是侬家嫌冷淡，敢将红粉向侬搽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40153,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独朵芙蓉","author":"徐渭","text":"荒沼芙蓉写一枝，即令憔悴不胜姿。\n文君卖酒成都日，独立垆头无侍儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40154,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"密蜂牡丹","author":"徐渭","text":"偶然墨扫牡丹枝，谁怪浓妆倚市窥。\n春色元非老人事，郭华尽尔买胭脂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40155,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浅色牡丹","author":"徐渭","text":"墨染娇姿浅绛勺，画中亦足赏青春。\n长安醉客靴为祟，去踏沉香亭上尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40156,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷花芙蓉","author":"徐渭","text":"荷花粉面芙蓉绯，貌两美人谁比伊。\n酒肆相如倍卓氏，扁舟西子伴鸱夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40157,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉石榴","author":"徐渭","text":"蕉叶屠埋短后衣，墨榴铁锈虎斑皮。\n老夫貌此堪谁比，朱亥椎临袖口时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40158,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"粉团","author":"徐渭","text":"号姨骑马去朝天，淡扫蛾眉真可怜。\n不识马头毬两串，也如枝上粉团团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40159,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葵榴","author":"徐渭","text":"明月珠含锦鹧鸪，丹砂肝胆向金乌。\n世间草木有如此，堪付徐熙入画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40160,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷","author":"徐渭","text":"荷花越女两相邻，小墨描颦别有神。\n再遇猿公溪水上，不愁输与斗青萍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40161,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉簪 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"南州颇兢玉簪粉，北里争插红姑娘。\n若教北里传观此，笑杀金钗十二行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40162,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉簪 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"若共水仙湘水滨，蛟宫添坐一夫人。\n无端生长颓墙下，将就徐熙为写神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40163,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹竹","author":"徐渭","text":"我学彭城写岁寒，何缘春色忽黄檀。\n正如三醉岳阳客，时访青楼白牡丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40164,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仿梅花道人竹画","author":"徐渭","text":"唤他是竹不应承，若唤为芦我不应。\n俗眼相逢莫评品，去问梅花吴道人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40165,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙兰竹","author":"徐渭","text":"水仙丛竹挟兰英，总是湘中三美人。\n莫遣嫦娥知此辈，定抛明月下江津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40166,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画水仙付鹫峰寺僧","author":"徐渭","text":"水仙画里妙氤氲，詹卜从兹等烂芸。\n安得香岩真鼻孔，一时成雾尽从闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40167,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"作牡丹送从子武会试","author":"徐渭","text":"近来懒病日关门，世事如毛等一髡。\n此际不知何以故，也将富贵望儿孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40168,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊","author":"徐渭","text":"内园木槿今无色，彭泽花枝别有春。\n草木从来无定准，一时抬价要高人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40169,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画萱吴子痛父冤因寿其母并及之","author":"徐渭","text":"忘忧尽好陪萱草，抱恨无过废蓼莪。\n寄语贤豪莫迂阔，教人易水送荆轲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40170,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏花牡丹","author":"徐渭","text":"牡丹巳谢三旬馀，为君写取最娇枝。\n惟应醉里县红壁，当取金钗劝酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40171,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古木悬萝图尽绕红叶鸦数十或栖或初归文待诏画也得郎字 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"长天古木染秋霜，红叶栖乌满夕阳。\n岂少踏枝翻一叶，只无诗句恼于郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40172,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古木悬萝图尽绕红叶鸦数十或栖或初归文待诏画也得郎字 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"红藤古树数雅行，大阵先栖小阵翔。\n莫作曹瞒三匝绕，汉阳江上有周郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40173,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花","author":"徐渭","text":"鸟啄梨花花欲稀，去从何处趁风微。\n傍人不解春光挽，只道清明有雪飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40174,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水墨牡丹","author":"徐渭","text":"腻粉轻黄不用匀，淡烟笼墨弄青春。\n从来国色无妆点，空染胭脂媚俗人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40175,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画竹赠子完得嗣","author":"徐渭","text":"仙母将雏绕绣裙，画成尽是凤毛群。\n不知若个思凡世，梦入君家载紫云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40176,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画蟹一首","author":"徐渭","text":"稻熟江村蟹正肥，双螯如戟挺青泥。\n若教纸上翻身看，应见团团董卓脐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40177,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题铁干海棠","author":"徐渭","text":"垂丝美女弄春绒，铁干贞姜赋国风。\n两样心肠一般色，画工描取莫相同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40178,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫薇花","author":"徐渭","text":"紫薇易开亦易残，紫薇热客有时寒。\n何如墨史将吟伯，岁岁年年画里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40179,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"徐渭","text":"海国名花说水仙，画中颜貌更婵娟。\n若非洒竹来湘浦，定是凌波出洛川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40180,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]